---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import { scale } from '../geometry';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

// Instructions executed by the two Fibonacci procedures of the note, counted per call path and checked against the
// simulator: the recursive fib costs 8 instructions on its base path and 23 on its recursive path, and makes F(n+1)
// base calls and F(n+1) - 1 recursive ones, so 31 F(n+1) - 23 in all; the iterative loop costs 5n + 5.
const F = [0, 1];
for (let i = 2; i <= 32; i++) F.push(F[i - 1] + F[i - 2]);
const rec = (n: number) => 31 * F[n + 1] - 23;
const it = (n: number) => 5 * n + 5;
const calls = (n: number) => 2 * F[n + 1] - 1;
if (rec(20) !== 339303 || it(20) !== 105 || calls(20) !== 21891 || F[20] !== 6765) throw new Error('FibCost: n = 20');
if (rec(30) !== 41734316) throw new Error('FibCost: n = 30');
const ns = Array.from({ length: 31 }, (_, n) => n);
const fmt = (v: number) => v.toLocaleString('en-US').replace(/,/g, ru ? ' ' : ',');
const ticks: [number, string][] = [[0, '1'], [2, '100'], [4, '10⁴'], [6, '10⁶'], [8, '10⁸']];
const layouts = [
  { cls: 'fig-wide', W: 760, H: 320, sfx: 'w', px: [70, 520] as [number, number], py: [20, 262] as [number, number], lx: 545, ly: 60 },
  { cls: 'fig-narrow', W: 360, H: 400, sfx: 'n', px: [52, 340] as [number, number], py: [20, 252] as [number, number], lx: 14, ly: 330 },
];
const id = 'procedures-and-the-stack-fib-cost';
---

<Figure
  id={id}
  title={ru ? 'Сколько команд стоит fib(n): рекурсия против цикла' : 'Instructions spent on fib(n): recursion against a loop'}
  caption={ru
    ? `Число выполненных команд RISC-V для двух процедур из заметки, логарифмическая шкала. Рекурсивная fib делает 2F(n + 1) − 1 вызовов и выполняет 31F(n + 1) − 23 команды: число растёт как F(n), примерно в 1.618 раза на каждую единицу n. Цикл выполняет 5n + 5 команд. Для n = 20: ${fmt(rec(20))} команд против ${fmt(it(20))}; для n = 30: ${fmt(rec(30))} против ${fmt(it(30))}. Эти числа точные, проверены симулятором и не зависят от машины; время выполнения зависит.`
    : `RISC-V instructions executed by the two procedures of the note, on a logarithmic scale. The recursive fib makes 2F(n + 1) − 1 calls and executes 31F(n + 1) − 23 instructions: the count grows like F(n), by a factor of about 1.618 per unit of n. The loop executes 5n + 5 instructions. For n = 20: ${fmt(rec(20))} instructions against ${fmt(it(20))}; for n = 30: ${fmt(rec(30))} against ${fmt(it(30))}. The counts are exact, checked with the simulator, and do not depend on the machine; the time does.`}
>
  {layouts.map((L) => {
    const sx = scale([0, 30], L.px), sy = scale([0, 8], [L.py[1], L.py[0]]);
    const pts = (f: (n: number) => number) => ns.map((n) => `${n ? 'L' : 'M'} ${sx(n).toFixed(1)} ${sy(Math.log10(f(n))).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
    return (
      <svg class={L.cls} viewBox={`0 0 ${L.W} ${L.H}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-${L.sfx}-t ${id}-${L.sfx}-d`}>
        <title id={`${id}-${L.sfx}-t`}>{ru ? 'Число команд рекурсивной и итеративной fib(n)' : 'Instruction counts of recursive and iterative fib(n)'}</title>
        <desc id={`${id}-${L.sfx}-d`}>{ru
          ? 'Логарифмическая ось числа команд от 1 до 10⁸ и ось n от 0 до 30. Кривая рекурсивной версии почти прямая на логарифмической шкале и доходит до 41.7 миллиона при n = 30; кривая цикла растёт медленно и при n = 30 равна 155.'
          : 'A logarithmic axis of instruction counts from 1 to 10⁸ against n from 0 to 30. The recursive curve is almost a straight line on the logarithmic scale and reaches 41.7 million at n = 30; the loop curve rises slowly and is 155 at n = 30.'}</desc>
        {ticks.map(([v]) => <path class="f-grid" d={`M ${L.px[0]} ${sy(v)} H ${L.px[1]}`} />)}
        <path class="f-axis" d={`M ${L.px[0]} ${L.py[0]} V ${L.py[1]} H ${L.px[1]}`} />
        {ticks.map(([v, s]) => <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x={L.px[0] - 7} y={sy(v) + 4} text-anchor="end">{s}</text>)}
        {[0, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30].map((n) => <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x={sx(n)} y={L.py[1] + 18} text-anchor="middle">{n}</text>)}
        <text class="f-small" x={(L.px[0] + L.px[1]) / 2} y={L.py[1] + 38} text-anchor="middle">n</text>
        <path class="f-line f-red" d={pts(rec)} />
        <path class="f-line f-blue" d={pts(it)} />
        {ns.map((n) => <circle cx={sx(n)} cy={sy(Math.log10(rec(n)))} r="2.6" class="f-solid-red" />)}
        {ns.map((n) => <circle cx={sx(n)} cy={sy(Math.log10(it(n)))} r="2.6" class="f-solid-blue" />)}
        <circle cx={sx(20)} cy={sy(Math.log10(rec(20)))} r="5" class="f-thin f-red" />
        <text class="f-small f-t-red f-halo" x={sx(20) - 8} y={sy(Math.log10(rec(20))) - 8} text-anchor="end">{fmt(rec(20))}</text>
        <circle cx={sx(20)} cy={sy(Math.log10(it(20)))} r="5" class="f-thin f-blue" />
        <text class="f-small f-t-blue f-halo" x={sx(20)} y={sy(Math.log10(it(20))) - 10} text-anchor="middle">{it(20)}</text>
        <path class="f-line f-red" d={`M ${L.lx} ${L.ly - 4} h 26`} />
        <text class="f-small" x={L.lx + 34} y={L.ly}>{ru ? 'рекурсия: 31F(n + 1) − 23' : 'recursion: 31F(n + 1) − 23'}</text>
        <path class="f-line f-blue" d={`M ${L.lx} ${L.ly + 20} h 26`} />
        <text class="f-small" x={L.lx + 34} y={L.ly + 24}>{ru ? 'цикл: 5n + 5' : 'loop: 5n + 5'}</text>
      </svg>
    );
  })}
</Figure>
